{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-tower-air-fryers-2503-0044","content_id":"fae5bae4-4f44-4518-8945-37214f0766f6","description":"Product Recall for Tower Air Fryers presenting a risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"1ffa6a65-c364-453b-9563-47630a33de86","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-09T13:31:48+00:00","id":"1ffa6a65-c364-453b-9563-47630a33de86","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-09T13:31:48+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69aecbc4bde9c3f213c899dc/2503-0094-product-recall-tower-air-fryers.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Tower Air Fryers</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as it may overheat and ignite during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Air Fryer</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Tower</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>T17023 Tower 2.2Ltr Manual Air Fryer, T17061BLK Tower 4Ltr Manual Air Fryer, T17067 Tower 4Ltr Digital Air Fryer (Sainsbury’s SKU: 143897281), T17087 Tower 2Ltr Compact Manual Air Fryer, T17129L Tower Vortx 8L Air Fryer (Lidl), and T17129 Tower Vortx 8L Air Fryer (Argos)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Six models of Tower air fryer in black. Affected products were manufactured between January 2022 and April 2023. Affected products have been sold by retailers including Argos, B&amp;M Bargains, DID, Poundland, Robert Dyas, Sainsbury’s, Tesco, and the Tower Housewares website.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_1ffa6a65-c364-453b-9563-47630a33de86\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69aecbc4bde9c3f213c899dc/2503-0094-product-recall-tower-air-fryers.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire as it can overheat and ignite during use.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users. Owners of affected products should stop using the product immediately and unplug it. </p>\n\n<p>For further information, including checking if your product is affected and registering your product for a refund or replacement, please access the Tower Housewares webpage: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tower-safety.co.uk/\">https://www.tower-safety.co.uk</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2503-0094, 2603-0060</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Addition of SKU for Sainsbury's, and additional PSD reference. ","public_timestamp":"2026-03-09T13:34:08Z"},{"note":"Additional models added to the recall. ","public_timestamp":"2025-07-24T10:59:31Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-08T19:22:58Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_typ